start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc 3ch {[3dc 3ch]x3 2dc}@ring ss@top
R2: ss@sp 3ch=dc 3ch 3dc@same [ch {3dc 3ch 3dc}@sp]x3 ch 2dc@same ss@top
